ng to determine that there was like  i said the  victim was parked in the roadway when  the other person approached him so we're  trying to figure out what led up to the  shooting  we don't know the specifics pertaining  to motive at this point  right now we're still getting some  conflicting information we're still  trying to  piece together that information right  now we're canvassing the area looking  for surveillance video to  see if we can get some answers to that  question right  thank you guys
 

